  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Abbacchio alla Romana uses the classic Roman "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "braising",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "braising"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " method: brown the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "abbacchio",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "abbacchio"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " pieces hard, then slow-cook them in wine and vinegar until falling-tender. Anchovies and rosemary make the sauce richly savoury. Serves 4 to 6."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Young lamb is traditional but good lamb shoulder gives the same silky result. Do not skip the browning step as it builds the flavour base."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
